          "no": 5,
          "code": "Upgrade with Airmiles",
          "description": "Upgrade with Airmiles",
          "note": "Flying Club Upgrades- to enable you to upgrade your Virgin Atlantic Flight \nusing your Flying Club Miles we will need to issue your tickets. \nWe automatically issue your tickets 2 weeks prior to your departure date,\n if you would like to upgrade soon please contact the Virgin Holidays Customer\n Service. Kindly note once your flights are ticketed they become non-refundable\n and full payment is required prior to processing.",
