        {
          "no": 7,
          "code": "FCDO Advice 1st March 2023 onwards",
          "description": "FCDO Advice 1st March 2023 onwards",
          "note": "Please check the Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office for the\n latest information on safety and security, local laws, latest travel information.\n Please also ensure you have familiarised yourself and made relevant \narrangements based on the information on passport, entry requirements and \nvisa requirements on the Gov.UK site.\n\nDo check regularly as the advice can change. As you\u2019d expect, due to COVID-19\nyour travel experience may be different to what you might be used to so \nplease familiarise yourself with the changes that may have been put in place \nfor your stay.",
          "dateModified": "2024-03-29T16:35:51",
