        {
          "no": 17,
          "code": "00011768",
          "description": "Disney Park Ticket Duration",
          "note": "7 Day Disney Magic Ticket: \n7 Day Walt Disney World Park admission. 7 Day Disney Magic Ticket is valid for \na 15-day window from the selected start date of the ticket. Please make sure\nyou choose the date of your first park visit as the start date of your ticket.\n\n14 Day Disney Magic Ticket:\n14 Day Walt Disney World Park admission. 14 Day Disney Magic Ticket is valid for\nan 18-day window from the selected start date of the ticket. Please make sure\nyou choose the date of your first park visit as the start date of your ticket.Disney Magic Tickets can be purchased for 7- or 14-day Walt Disney World Park\nadmission. \n\n14 Day Disney Magic Ticket: 14 Day Walt Disney World Park admission. 14 Day\nDisney Magic Ticket is valid for an 18-day window from the selected start date of\nthe ticket.\n\n7 Day Disney Magic Ticket: 7 Day Walt Disney World Park admission. 7 Day\nDisney Magic Ticket is valid for a 15-day window from the selected start date \nof the ticket.\n\nFor the 7 or 14- Day Disney Magic Ticket selected please make sure you \nchoose the date of your first park visit as the start date of your ticket.",
          "dateModified": "2025-02-16T22:38:00",
