          "description": "Universal Ticket Advisory 4 Park",
          "note": "Our Universal Orlando Tickets give you 14 consecutive days of unlimited park\naccess to Universal Studios Florida, Universal\u2019s Islands of Adventure, Epic \nUniverse and Universal\u2019s Volcano Bay water theme park.\n\nPlease make sure you choose the date of your first park visit as the \nstarting date for your tickets",
